[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1082.51, "timestamp": "00:18:02", "text": "當心。啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1087.47, "timestamp": "00:18:07", "text": "不是“小心，小心”。啊，穿上它們。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1092.47, "timestamp": "00:18:12", "text": "我不穿它們，也沒有我的位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1097.71, "timestamp": "00:18:17", "text": "說沒關係。但現在，直播時間為1小時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1102.35, "timestamp": "00:18:22", "text": "我之前在公車上用過一點Chapi，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1108.71, "timestamp": "00:18:28", "text": "哦，我寫了一封郵件。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1113.27, "timestamp": "00:18:33", "text": "因為我用日文說了「啊」。我買了整套。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1117.149, "timestamp": "00:18:37", "text": "不，不，我寫的是類似「作文」之類的東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1120.23, "timestamp": "00:18:40", "text": "我寫作是因為我有所期盼。因為我渴望如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1123.27, "timestamp": "00:18:43", "text": "沒有。哦，這可是個大問題。其實沒那麼難。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1129.11, "timestamp": "00:18:49", "text": "。因為這很難。哦，是誰？等等等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1134.789, "timestamp": "00:18:54", "text": "不掛。到目前為止，我的主要合作夥伴是誰？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1139.87, "timestamp": "00:18:59", "text": "而且沒有人說日語。一點點"}]